fter renaming for each of them.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create default audio bus layout\n2. Create an additional audio bus\n3. Set the additional audio bus as a bus for any AudioStreamPlayer\n4. Rename the additional audio bus\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112981/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112981/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}